      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "That's fantastic news about the audit results. To capitalize on the current scenario and hit your upsell goals, you could present the audit findings as an opportunity. Applaud their solid network, highlighting the trust they've placed in our partnership, but also subtly emphasize the additional benefits that the Advanced Continuous Monitoring package offers, even for systems which appear robust during standard inspections. It's about positioning this as a value-add rather than a necessity.",
